COMMENT ON COLUMN text_polish_record.payload IS '必填JSON对象，无默认值；当前顶层键id/input/generatedText/polishedText/sourceRecordId/sourceMode/modelId/modelName/mock/editRevision/checks/historySaved/persistentHistory/createdAt/executionMetadata。input含sourceText/style/depth/audience/requirements/lockedTexts/modelId，lockedTexts是原文精确保留字符串数组；checks为code/message/before/after对象数组。executionMetadata由服务端生成，旧记录缺失或NULL表示未知；含strategyVersion/skillVersion/resourceHash/repairInstructionHash/routeKey/upstreamModel/parameters/attemptCount/selection/resources/directedRevision。skillVersion为NULL表示未加载技能，resourceHash为首稿system指令UTF-8的SHA-256，repairInstructionHash仅在首稿协议修复时有值，mock无指令哈希；parameters含maxTokens/maxCompletionTokens/temperature/stream/responseFormat/thinking，仅记录实际发送值，NULL表示未发送或未知。selection非空时含selectorVersion/language/profile/reason；language应用值ZH中文、EN英文、MIXED混合、UNKNOWN语言不确定或无专门资源；profile当前GENERAL表示按全文判断用途；reason当前SOURCE_LANGUAGE_EVIDENCE为正文语言依据，INSUFFICIENT_OR_UNSUPPORTED_LANGUAGE为通用回退依据。resources缺失或NULL表示未采集，空数组表示未加载，非空为id/version/sha256对象数组，sha256为规范化资源正文UTF-8的SHA-256。directedRevision缺失或NULL表示无追加修订快照，非空时含strategyVersion/instructionHash/outcome；instructionHash为追加阶段system指令UTF-8的SHA-256，outcome应用值APPLIED已替换首段、UNCHANGED保留初稿、FALLBACK追加失败后保留首稿。attemptCount包含首稿、协议修复和已发起的追加尝试，mock为0。快照不含供应商端点或密钥。generatedText保留生成原件，当前正文和修订以独立列为准；记录以账号、租户和工作区隔离。数据库仅检查顶层对象，不强制内部键或值域';
